id: pm-oi4zs3
title: "GH-778: make lean structured reads omit caller echoes and inactive pagination metadata"
description: Small JSON reads still spend more tokens on query echoes and derivable envelope metadata than on item payloads because lean mode only removes null or empty containers.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
