author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Lean JSON omits caller-echoed filters sorting projection and now metadata; next_cursor is present only when continuation is possible; Full JSON remains contract-compatible and an explicit diagnostic projection retains query explanations; Measured isolated small-read output falls by at least 50 percent without losing actionable pagination state
goal: project management = context management
objective: Minimize repeated agent read overhead through an intentional SDK output projection
value: More context budget remains available for actual project decisions
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: Reduced lean structured envelopes to decision-relevant fields and preserved active pagination continuity with focused regression coverage.
expected_result: Lean structured reads expose only actionable result data and include pagination metadata only when another page exists.
actual_result: Lean envelopes omit caller filter/time/projection/sorting echoes and inactive cursors while retaining next_cursor when has_more is true.
